     1,
     "<div><div>Hi -- that error means what it says.  Do <br></div><div><br></div><div>length(<span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:&quot;Lucida Console&quot;,monospace;font-size:13.3333px\">possible_ranges_list_txt)</span></div><div><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:&quot;Lucida Console&quot;,monospace;font-size:13.3333px\">length(</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:&quot;Lucida Console&quot;,monospace;font-size:13.3333px\">colors_list_for_states)</span></div><div><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:&quot;Lucida Console&quot;,monospace;font-size:13.3333px\"><br></span></div><div><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:&quot;Lucida Console&quot;,monospace;font-size:13.3333px\">...they must be the same.  I think these issues are just all about carefully tracking what exactly is in the list of possible ranges/states, the list of colors for each range/state, etc...</span></div><div><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:&quot;Lucida Console&quot;,monospace;font-size:13.3333px\"><br></span></div><div><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:&quot;Lucida Console&quot;,monospace;font-size:13.3333px\">Cheers!</span></div><div><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:&quot;Lucida Console&quot;,monospace;font-size:13.3333px\">Nick</span></div></div>"
